user add alice
user add bob
user add carol
user add dave
publish alice sec 1.0.0
owner invite alice sec bob
owner accept bob sec
owner invite alice sec dave role=reader
owner accept dave sec
clock set 1000
publish alice sec 1.1.0 embargo=2h
resolve carol sec ^1
resolve bob sec ^1
resolve dave sec ^1
resolve carol sec =1.1.0
fetch carol sec
info alice sec
clock set 8199
resolve carol sec ^1
clock set 8200
resolve carol sec ^1
fetch carol sec
